# 🚀 Day 30 – Supply Chain Builder

## 📌 Challenge Overview

Day 30 focused on building **Supply Chain Builder**, an interactive educational web application using **Claude AI**. The simulator teaches supply chain fundamentals through hands-on decision-making, allowing users to build a supply chain from scratch while understanding the trade-offs behind every business decision.

The project demonstrates how AI can transform complex business concepts into engaging, beginner-friendly learning experiences.

---

# 🏭 Project Description

**Supply Chain Builder**

An interactive React-based simulation where users create and optimize a company's supply chain by making strategic decisions related to suppliers, manufacturing, warehousing, transportation, and inventory management.

Each playthrough generates a different company profile, making every simulation unique.

