# 🎓 Key Learnings

- Supply chains require balancing cost, speed, resilience, and customer satisfaction.
- Every operational decision has trade-offs that impact overall business performance.
- Multiple suppliers improve resilience but can increase complexity.
- AI can simplify complex business education through interactive simulations.
- Prompt engineering enables rapid development of realistic enterprise applications.

